{
  "id": 8834714534087,
  "title": "Cardinals Perched Beside Decorated Christmas Tree Patchwork Winter Quilt",
  "handle": "cardinals-perched-beside-decorated-christmas-tree-patchwork-winter-quilt-7cd7bc46a0-7cd7bc46a0",
  "body_html": "<p>Transform your bedroom into a cozy winter haven with this custom cardinal-themed bedding from Jeminise. Featuring a beautiful holiday illustration of red cardinal birds perched beside a decorated Christmas tree, this quilt brings warmth, togetherness, and festive charm to any space. It is the perfect personalized addition to your guest bedroom, vacation home, or a thoughtful Christmas gift for bird lovers and family.</p>\n<h3>Key Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Customizable Design:</strong> Personalize your quilt with custom text inputs and optional matching pillowcases to complete your perfect bedding set.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Soft &amp; Comforting Fabric:</strong> Crafted with a breathable soft polyester outer layer and filled with high-quality silk floss for lightweight, all-season warmth.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Versatile Use:</strong> Highly functional as a bed quilt, cozy throw blanket, picnic mat, or outdoor camping companion.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Offered in five convenient sizes including Throw (60x70 in), Twin (68x86 in), Full (80x90 in), Queen (90x90 in), and King (91x102 in).</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable in cold water; dries quickly on air dry without heat to regain its fluffy, soft texture.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Product Specifications</h3>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Quilt Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fill Material</th>\n<td>Silk Floss</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Design</th>\n<td>Xmas Red Bird-01</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Bird</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Cardinal Christmas Tree</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>Winter / All Seasons</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
